    BAGIAN 5. KONFIGURASI DNS BIND9
    ============================================================

    22. INSTALL DAN AKTIFKAN BIND9

    sudo apt install bind9 bind9-utils bind9-dnsutils -y
    sudo systemctl enable --now named


    23. KONFIGURASI ZONA DNS

    Buka file:

    sudo 

    Tambahkan konfigurasi berikut:

    zone "ukom12tkja-32.sch.id" {
    type master;
    file "/etc/bind/db.ukom12tkja-32.sch.id";
};

zone "32.100.100.in-addr.arpa" {
    type master;
    file "/etc/bind/db.100.100.32";
};


